Package: porchlight
Version: 2.1
Section: video
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: zoneminder, default-mysql-server, python3, pkexec, xdg-utils, curl, ffmpeg
Recommends: python3-onnxruntime
Maintainer: Porchlight <porchlight@localhost>
Description: Porchlight - simple security camera setup
 A plain-language app for adding IP cameras to ZoneMinder. Finds cameras on
 your network, fills in the technical details for you, shows every camera at
 once in a live wall, plays back recordings, and keeps the expert ZoneMinder
 options one click away. Installing it also installs and configures
 ZoneMinder itself, so there is nothing to set up by hand.
